Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.10,0:00:02.92,English,en-0,0,0,0,,{\q2}Regrouping means both armies have reached the
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.10,0:00:05.30,Chinese,zh-0,0,0,0,,{\q2}会合是两队到了同一地点，合并以后才成为一支。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:02.92,0:00:05.75,English,en-1,0,0,0,,{\q2}same place; only merging turns them into one.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:05.30,0:00:08.22,Chinese,zh-1,0,0,0,,{\q2}合后要再读库存、容量、
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.75,0:00:10.84,English,en-2,0,0,0,,{\q2}After the merge, reread stock, capacity, the actual commander, and every regiment.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:08.22,0:00:10.87,Chinese,zh-2,0,0,0,,{\q2}实际统帅和全部兵团。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.84,0:00:14.63,English,en-3,0,0,0,,{\q2}Count the original regiments separately from later additions.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:10.87,0:00:16.43,Chinese,zh-3,0,0,0,,{\q2}原始兵团与后来新增的记录分开统计；如果合法合军改变
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.63,0:00:17.73,English,en-4,0,0,0,,{\q2}If a legal merge changes these conditions, retain
Dialogue: 2,0:00:16.43,0:00:21.99,Chinese,zh-4,0,0,0,,{\q2}了这些条件，就把变化作为这次安排的实际后果，不能删
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.73,0:00:20.51,English,en-5,0,0,0,,{\q2}those changes as actual consequences of this
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.51,0:00:21.27,English,en-6,0,0,0,,{\q2}arrangement.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.27,0:00:24.16,English,en-7,0,0,0,,{\q2}Do not delete new entries or change commanders
Dialogue: 2,0:00:21.99,0:00:27.11,Chinese,zh-5,0,0,0,,{\q2}掉新增记录，或事后换将，把结果修成预想的样子。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.16,0:00:27.17,English,en-8,0,0,0,,{\q2}afterward to make the result match expectations.
